            <div xml:id="m-0c811ebf-206c-4603-88f3-9b5f88c5e15f">
              <lg xml:id="m-72245ea8-5927-4c8c-a7e3-22e3e9f9e1b2">
                <l xml:id="m-5324430d-6d16-4731-98dd-f48e3b5689dd" facs="#m-990ab574-a6fe-49ac-a92b-41a37d5fc532" label="text-like">At Matins.</l><l xml:id="m-b1c0b396-a758-4ede-93f9-1c8bb8c4a755" facs="#m-0173ef32-e8df-4395-8826-14875f940265" label="ambiguous">869</l><l xml:id="m-568f262b-39e2-4bc2-9a3c-66f73b26f9db" facs="#m-05b05fdb-6bc6-4e7a-8dc1-5f54a22629e1" label="lyrics-like">10. Laetétur mons Sion, et exsúltent filiae Júdae, *propter judicia</l><l xml:id="m-38a7f3b3-4434-49ce-99c1-239798fbfedf" facs="#m-9c91e2df-30af-457f-b08b-1070627d5bc3" label="lyrics-like">túa Dómine.</l><l xml:id="m-54d77ab2-bc41-4243-a901-1d9a921912ec" facs="#m-ed719662-ec07-454a-86dc-c1951a083663" label="lyrics-like">11. Circúmdate Sion, et complectímini éam:*narráte in túrribus</l><l xml:id="m-5b8a8b60-6dbe-44e9-9928-2053ce27f1b6" facs="#m-bb442acb-74cb-4df8-afcf-a74fb8d22c33" label="lyrics-like">éjus.</l><l xml:id="m-ebce954d-02bf-4e1c-91bf-bc760349384f" facs="#m-0adb2e0d-c6a5-4aac-9674-3a22fbc70ca4" label="lyrics-like">12. Pónite córda véstra in virtúte éjus:* et distribuite dómos éjus,</l><l xml:id="m-303e04e6-d5f7-40c8-846d-1c29878aa354" facs="#m-812dffc8-4f13-4241-98c6-6981f51f7bac" label="lyrics-like">ut enarrétis in progénie áltera.</l><l xml:id="m-29d1f17b-8f1f-4d4f-b888-e777cf7ac789" facs="#m-046ce4ac-e3a3-4d72-a280-6b3775221c12" label="lyrics-like">13. Quóniam hic est Déus, Déus nóster in aetérnum, et in saéculum</l><l xml:id="m-4f02101d-5bd6-4c98-a8eb-2681c5cdc559" facs="#m-62c9ce17-2979-4df1-a5ad-173114ffd681" label="lyrics-like">saéculi :*Ipse réget nos in saécula.</l><l xml:id="m-87a47497-0fef-4313-910a-ddb6e4bb4fec" facs="#m-f6c5213e-650c-4ff6-b1b3-7f07f78a7bd8" label="lyrics-like">14. Glória Pátri, et Filio, *et Spiritai Sáncto.</l><l xml:id="m-2047bc1b-7ff4-4545-981b-5a199560dfa5" facs="#m-301dd969-bb6e-4fe6-80d4-d35198e4b61f" label="lyrics-like">15. Sicut érat in princípio, et nunc, et sémper, * et in saécula saecu¬</l><l xml:id="m-a8815d0a-2316-46cc-869b-009b0b372050" facs="#m-58a30f03-d892-4b66-8166-66acab152d26" label="lyrics-like">tóram. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-43e3bae6-795f-4242-9e9d-4c6261c2d868" facs="#m-850d66eb-432b-44d5-9eeb-40c5046dd14a" label="ambiguous">2. Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-eba53999-2cdb-486d-a3da-bacdce41b887" facs="#m-f52dd2e5-8896-43f2-8700-12551a34cd2b" label="ambiguous">s. e</l><l xml:id="m-18349f91-06ba-4d63-ae7e-d9759d95692d" facs="#m-a2c60d2e-bdb3-486c-b967-059f92568026" label="lyrics-like">Onfírma hoc Dé¬ us, “ quod operá-tus es in nó¬</l><l xml:id="m-a9ee5a92-a87c-4845-add4-ecc0d293bfb9" facs="#m-4420bfc5-967f-4c8f-9946-1ee15d622ca7" label="lyrics-like">bis: a témplo sáncto tú¬o quod est in Jerú-salem, alle¬</l><l xml:id="m-726c5eff-c6ad-4981-9afd-6c74f94457e6" facs="#m-272eac7b-8189-4fc0-8a8a-60c51c310975" label="lyrics-like">lú-ia, alle-lú-ia.</l><l xml:id="m-9b4d0898-4683-4aa3-9da6-3aa7b874d8bc" facs="#m-c5503e45-b3be-4b26-8660-bdd209a0e03e" label="ambiguous">Psalm 67.</l><l xml:id="m-00e93271-40b2-4d1a-b1e6-5c37f306b9f7" facs="#m-434bc4db-28d2-4cf7-8bd8-b63d562f583f" label="lyrics-like">1. Exsúrgat Dé-us, et dissipéntur inimí-ci é¬ jus: * et fú¬</l><l xml:id="m-d610d047-9259-4ba5-a2ed-2ae0528d2724" facs="#m-dfe3171f-e6e0-416c-a20e-a08f08a9f9d3" label="lyrics-like">gi-ant qui odérunt é-um, a fáci-e é jus. Flex: nómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-ff8a5ded-2312-43b1-b990-626f8075e789" facs="#m-2ff27f06-1ee6-4ddd-ac79-fcf0892a8fed" label="lyrics-like">ni é¬ jus:</l><l xml:id="m-1fd3026e-470b-43e2-bbb0-636d44136239" facs="#m-106d7de2-d23d-4b20-b32f-bb045fb7075a" label="lyrics-like">2. Sicut déficit fúmus, deficiant:*sicut fluit céra a fácie ignis, sic</l><l xml:id="m-00174df7-adbe-400a-bd74-5330e829df4b" facs="#m-7ece21f1-00ec-4e6e-a4ed-191ec1a539cd" label="lyrics-like">péreant peccatóres a fâcte Déi.</l><l xml:id="m-49154d96-3fef-4a1d-bf87-a9148db83b9d" facs="#m-56f2434a-17e9-4acb-ab2d-70ac2c7290ef" label="lyrics-like">3. Et jústi epuléntur, et exsúltent in conspéctu Déi:*et delecténtur</l><l xml:id="m-50096168-335d-4aaa-95d6-7bca6a541f68" facs="#m-c16fe1a2-375f-4a36-bb43-2a6dbf37c6ee" label="ambiguous">tn lœctitia.</l><l xml:id="m-d91041f0-6475-4e9b-b63b-ad778ad67c7d" facs="#m-6a0acaf0-3f5e-476f-ad24-c4f26beb78d4" label="lyrics-like">4. Cantáte Déo, psálmum dícite nómini éjus: t ster fácite éi, qui</l><l xml:id="m-4d283c72-cd6a-4f9e-a55a-899a16eeffee" facs="#m-e7c15b8f-7dbe-40d9-b39f-426e7b14d206" label="lyrics-like">ascéndit super oceásum: "Dóminus nómen illi¬</l><l xml:id="m-8a159439-5992-4959-bec4-38fc85884854" facs="#m-e61a020a-f223-4cf4-a8a9-d16b4c2f453e" label="ambiguous">Ne 801 — 34</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
